OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine day, with early cloud in
OL,6,Fplaces breaking up to leave some warm
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Temperatures will be
OL,8,Fnear average with mainly light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FAreas of cloud and some
OL,11,Fclearer periods. Most parts dry but
OL,12,Fthicker cloud developing across the
OL,13,FPennines later with patchy light rain
OL,14,Fand drizzle, along with some hill fog.
OL,15,FMild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAreas of cloud giving some
OL,18,Fpatchy rain or showers but also some
OL,19,Fdrier, brighter periods. Feeling warm
OL,20,Fwith winds freshening later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
