OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FChangeable, with showers or longer
OL,7,Fspells of rain, interspersed with
OL,8,Fdrier, brighter periods. Temperatures
OL,9,Fshould start a little above normal at
OL,10,Ffirst, but should trend nearer normal
OL,11,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
